<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 179 FOR EIGHT AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 179 FOR EIGHT AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa, chasing a victory target of 461, were 179 for eight in their second innings at lunch on the fifth day of the third and final cricket test against India on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 237 and 400-7 declared. South Africa 177 and 179-8 at lunch (H.Cronje 50, L.Klusener 34 not out, A.Hudson 31, S.Joshi 3-66, J.Srinath 2-38).</p>
</text>
